# reviews-guard.manifest — the Judge.me review-widget CONTRACT.
# deploy.sh enforces this on every run. It changes ONLY when a widget change is intended
# (then re-run deploy.sh with --reviews-changed and commit the updated reviews-guard.lock).
#
# Format (pipe-delimited, spaces around the pipes):
#   REPO | <repo file path>        | <required marker substring proving the embed/accessor is present>
#   LIVE | <rendered url>          | <required marker substring that must appear in the served HTML>
#
# REPO markers prove the embed is wired in the theme SOURCE (so a deploy can't silently drop it).
# LIVE markers prove the widget actually renders after deploy.

# --- REPO: source files carrying a Judge.me embed or the reviews.rating accessor ---
REPO | templates/page.reviews.json | all_reviews_page
REPO | templates/product.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.clinical-strength-cream.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.clinical-strength-gel.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.clinical-strength-spray.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.advanced-strength-cream.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.advanced-strength-gel.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.advanced-strength-spray.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.professional-strength-cream.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.professional-strength-gel.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.professional-strength-spray.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.foaming-cleanser.json | preview_badge
REPO | templates/product.bundle.json | preview_badge
REPO | sections/senseless-reviews.liquid | @app
REPO | sections/senseless-product-hero.liquid | @app
REPO | sections/senseless-collection-grid.liquid | judgeme
REPO | snippets/senseless-structured-data.liquid | product.metafields.reviews.rating
REPO | blocks/review.liquid | product.metafields.reviews.rating

# --- LIVE: rendered widgets that must survive every deploy ---
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/pages/reviews | jdgm-widget
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/pages/reviews | jdgm-histogram
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/products/clinical-strength-cream | jdgm-review-snippet-widget
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/products/clinical-strength-cream | jdgm-widget
